- Last 4 ($p_{21}$–$p_{24}$): $73+79+83+89 = 324$

$$\sum_{i=1}^{24} p_i = 129 + 510 + 324 = 963$$

$$a_{25} = 2 + 963 = 965$$

Therefore:
$$i = a_{25} + 1 = 966$$

## Verification

- $f_{965} = p_{25} = 97 < 100$ (last value below 100)
- $f_{966} = 2 \times 97 = 194 \ge 100$
